### 登录 - 正确密码
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 登录 - 错误密码
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "wrong"
}

### 登录 - 用户不存在
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "notexist",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 登录 - 空用户名
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 登录 - 空密码
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": ""
}



### 注册 - 正常情况
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "abc123",
  "name": "测试用户",
  "email": "test@example.com"
}

### 注册 - 用户已存在
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "abc123",
  "name": "测试用户",
  "email": "test1@example.com"
}

