### 编辑用户 - 正常情况
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/admin/users/6
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{admin_token}}

{
  "name": "测试用户修改",
  "email": "test_updated@example.com",
  "roleCode": "MANAGER",
  "status": 1
}

### 编辑用户 - 用户不存在
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/admin/users/999
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{admin_token}}

{
  "name": "测试用户",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "roleCode": "STAFF",
  "status": 1
}

### 编辑用户 - 邮箱已被其他用户使用
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/admin/users/6
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{admin_token}}

{
  "name": "测试用户",
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "roleCode": "STAFF",
  "status": 1
}

